  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as object possession, except as noted above. The possessed animated object has a number of Construction Points appropriate for its size (up to 5 CP for Gargantuan objects). Your silver cord extends to medium range (100 ft. + 10 ft./level).\n\nYou can attempt to possess a construct instead of an unattended object as your first possession with this spell. If you do, this spell acts as control constructUM, except as noted above.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions as object possession, except as noted above. the possessed animated object has a number of construction points appropriate for its size (up to 5 cp for gargantuan objects). your silver cord extends to medium range (100 ft. + 10 ft./level).\\n\\nyou can attempt to possess a construct instead of an unattended object as your first possession with this spell. if you do, this spell acts as control constructum, except as noted above.\"",
